    "title": "SENIOR MENUS",
    "text": "The Jamestown Golf Course is open from 9 a.m. to 1 p.m. weekdays. Seniors should arrive for lunch at 11:30 a.m. Suggested fee is $3. Call 423-2658 for reservations 48 hours in advance.\nAll takeout meals are served with potato chips, milk and choice of three-bean salad or fruit cup.\nMonday, Dec. 29\nSausage and pepper sandwich, three-bean salad, Greek salad, vegetable barley soup, Lorna Doone cookie. Takeout option is chicken salad sandwich.\nTuesday, Dec. 30\nChicken marsala, rice pilaf, baby carrots, chicken rice soup, sliced fruit. Takeout option is tossed salad with chicken.\nWednesday, Dec. 31\nScrambled eggs, O’Brien potatoes, sliced ham, muffins, orange juice. Takeout option is bagel sandwich.\nThursday, Jan. 1\nClosed for New Year’s Day\nFriday, Jan. 2\nSloppy joe, coleslaw, roasted potatoes, Mediterranean lentil soup, cake. Takeout option is ham and cheese sandwich.",
